/SystemCoordinator","line":73},{"title":"Immersive experiences","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/immersive-experiences","line":77},{"title":"Maintaining a shared context","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/shareplay#Maintaining-a-shared-context","line":81},{"title":"Adjusting a shared context","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/shareplay#Adjusting-a-shared-context","line":85},{"title":"Playing audio","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/playing-audio","line":87},{"title":"An image of a private TV window in visionOS, with a translucent button above the window labeled Not Shared.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/4d6d10f5b53dbe935c61cadf9a4c400c/visionos-shareplay-status-idle%402x.png","line":99,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of a private TV window in visionOS, with the button above the window selected. A menu emerges downward from the button with options for sharing the window.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/04fc57f305c864a6162e1ac4f470b551/visionos-shareplay-status-selected%402x.png","line":101,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of a shared TV window in visionOS. The button above the window is labeled with the SharePlay icon and the text Shared.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d0310d65563f9a03ccbcc738ead1be77/visionos-shareplay-status-sharing%402x.png","line":103,"embedded":true},{"title":"Adjusting a shared context","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/shareplay#Adjusting-a-shared-context","line":105},{"title":"An image of a TV window in visionOS. The image is split down the center to contrast the personalized experiences of two people: Person 1 has subtitles turned on, while Person 2 has subtitles turned off.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/adc28b9c915736776dbb296379be01b9/visionos-shareplay-subtitles-personalization%402x.png","line":111,"embedded":true},{"title":"Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/shareplay#Resources","line":117},{"title":"Related","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/shareplay#Related","line":119},{"title":"Auto-renewable subscriptions","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/in-app-purchase#Auto-renewable-subscriptions","line":121},{"title":"Developer documentation","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/shareplay#Developer-documentation","line":123},{"title":"Group Activities","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/GroupActivities","line":125},{"title":"Videos","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/shareplay#Videos","line":127},{"title":"![","target":"https://devimages-cdn.apple.com/wwdc-services/images/3055294D-836B-4513-B7B0-0BC5666246B0/27EAC954-289C-4966-9422-B86B964D4BED/10055_wide_250x141_1x.jpg","line":129},{"title":"![","target":"https://devimages-cdn.apple.com/wwdc-services/images/D35E0E85-CCB6-41A1-B227-7995ECD83ED5/942191E7-9B98-487D-AE81-400D58285B31/8129_wide_250x141_1x.jpg","line":131},{"title":"![","target":"https://devimages-cdn.apple.com/wwdc-services/images/D35E0E85-CCB6-41A1-B227-7995ECD83ED5/C1ABC187-BCC7-4576-A088-141E732E411A/8303_wide_250x141_1x.jpg","line":133},{"title":"Change log","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/shareplay#Change-log","line":135}],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:ai stuff/antigravity-awesome-skills/skills/hig-technologies/references/shareplay.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"0","at":1779618284263},"key":"ai stuff/antigravity-awesome-skills/skills/hig-technologies/references/shareplay.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1